  "summary": "SFPD released body cam video and additional details about a May 31 incident in which an ALPR alerted officers to armed robbery suspects entering San Francisco via the Bay Bridge, leading to a pursuit, crash, and shootout that injured Officer Brittney Taylor and a suspect passenger. The driver, Norris Reed III, was arrested and charged with attempted murder.",
